---

<section class="fullwidth-section alt-section direktur-section" id="direktur">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="editorial-grid">
      <!-- Left Column: Owner Photo -->
      <div class="direktur-photo-col">
        <div class="direktur-image-frame">
          <img src="/images/hero-owner.jpg" alt="Ilham Pradani - Direktur Utama PT CHAIN ASIA CONECT" class="owner-photo" />
        </div>
        <div class="owner-tag">
          <span class="tag-title">ILHAM PRADANI</span>
          <span class="tag-role red-text">Direktur Utama & Pemilik Entitas</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Biography & Quote -->
      <div class="direktur-text-col">
        <div class="red-badge">
          <span>Kepemimpinan Eksekutif</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="direktur-heading">
          Ilham Pradani
        </h2>
        <span class="direktur-subtitle red-text">Direktur Utama PT CHAIN ASIA CONECT</span>

        <div class="red-line-small"></div>

        <blockquote class="direktur-quote">
          “Keputusan strategis untuk merambah ke sektor bisnis riil di kawasan Krui, Pesisir Barat, merupakan langkah transformasi usaha yang terukur dan berorientasi pada keberlanjutan. Melalui keselarasan filosofi identitas korporat dan standar operasional yang profesional, perusahaan berkomitmen menjadi mitra strategis yang andal dalam mendukung pertumbuhan industri lokal dan regional.”
        </blockquote>

        <div class="direktur-specs">
          <div class="spec-item">
            <span class="spec-label">Perusahaan:</span>
            <strong class="spec-val">PT CHAIN ASIA CONECT</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-item">
            <span class="spec-label">Website Owner:</span>
            <a href="https://ilhampradani.me" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="spec-link red-text">https://ilhampradani.me</a>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-item">
            <span class="spec-label">Email Direksi:</span>
            <a href="mailto:hello@ilhampradani.me" class="spec-link">hello@ilhampradani.me</a>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-item">
            <span class="spec-label">SK Legalitas:</span>
            <span class="spec-val">AHU-A117353.AH.01.30.Tahun 2026</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="direktur-actions">
          <a href="https://ilhampradani.me" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-red btn-red-outline">
            <span>Profil Owner</span>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"></line></svg>
          </a>
          <a href="https://wa.me/6288971071138" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-red">
            <span>Hubungi Direksi (WhatsApp)</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .direktur-section {
    position: relative;
  }

  .direktur-photo-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .direktur-image-frame {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 380px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 3px solid #ffffff;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  .owner-photo {
    width: 100%;
    height: 440px;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .owner-tag {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .tag-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-dark);
  }

  .tag-role {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .direktur-heading {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.8vw, 3rem);
    margin-top: 0.85rem;
  }

  .direktur-subtitle {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .direktur-quote {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--text-body);
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--red-primary);
  }

  .direktur-specs {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 0;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .spec-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.925rem;
  }

  .spec-label {
    width: 130px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .spec-val, .spec-link {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .direktur-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .spec-item {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 0.15rem;
    }
    .spec-label {
      width: 100%;
    }
    .direktur-actions {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
